- op: discuss  # c6c8
  at: '2026-10-22T04:26:42Z'  # c6c8
  by: agent  # c6c8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # c6c8
  clock: 7  # c6c8
  nonce: c6c8  # c6c8
  message: "REOPENED 2026-10-22: PR #1797 reverted by PR #1799. The 2026-10-21 concept audit (F1, ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept_audit_10212026/) found that putting Go's blank '_' into stmt_defuse's defines slot made two consumers read it as a variable. Verified through the production CLI, claim host_secret -> subprocess: (a) '_, err := get(); fmt.Println(err); exec.Command(\"ls\")' with get returning os.Getenv, and (b) 's, _ := tok.(string); fmt.Println(s); exec.Command(\"ls\")' read confirmed_with_caveats (exit 3) before e9215548f6, violated (exit 1, ddg_mixed/escaped) after it, and exit 3 again on merged dev after the revert. Causes: taint inherits made '_' an heir with no recorded use (unrecorded_heir escape); _received_seeds seeded {'_'}, which the walk reads as source_undefined. RE-FIX SHAPE: carry positions APART from defines (stmt_defuse defines stay bindings), and make a received position that lands on a blank mean 'nothing received' (seed nothing / lift nothing), not 'unknown'. Tests to carry: the two fixtures above (must stay exit 3) plus the original pair (blank at the value's position discards it; value, _ := keeps it)."  # c6c8
